15
01:58.120 --> 01:59.150
It is a great honor

16
01:59.810 --> 02:01.740
for our party to have you, Madam Ching-ling,

17
02:01.740 --> 02:03.900
and Mr. Lu Xun

18
02:04.950 --> 02:06.220
