21
02:10.590 --> 02:11.400
Have a seat.

22
02:11.470 --> 02:12.240
Please.

23
02:15.150 --> 02:16.490
I really want to know about

24
02:16.490 --> 02:18.820
your stories on the Westward Expedition.

25
02:19.400 --> 02:20.840
Tell me about it.

26
02:22.200 --> 02:24.190
During the Long March of the Red Army,

27
02:24.190 --> 02:27.320
Soong Ching-ling, Lu Xun, and other left-wing patriots

28
02:27.520 --> 02:30.010
lived in Shanghai under the White Terror

29
02:30.040 --> 02:32.220
and tight blockade of the Kuomintang,

30
02:32.700 --> 02:36.140
but they paid attention to the fate of the Party and the Red Army at all times.

31
02:36.140 --> 02:37.800
And they gave support to the Party and the Red Army

32
02:37.800 --> 02:40.210
in their own ways,

33
02:42.220 --> 02:44.540
In early August 1935,

34
02:44.950 --> 02:48.440
Chen Yun and other Party members who were preparing to go to Moscow,

35
02:48.440 --> 02:50.360
boarded a ship bound for the Soviet Union

36
02:50.360 --> 02:53.310
with the help of Soong Ching-ling.

37
02:55.630 --> 03:00.660
[Northern Edge of the SongPan Grassland, Sichuan; Left Flank Vanguard Regiment of the Right Route Army of the Red Army]

38
03:14.450 --> 03:18.340
[Yang Chengwu, Political Commissar of the 4th Red Regiment]

39
03:20.050 --> 03:20.800
Comrade,

40
03:21.400 --> 03:22.150
put me down.

41
03:23.130 --> 03:24.290
I'll walk by myself.

42
03:24.910 --> 03:25.960
Old gentleman.

43
03:27.450 --> 03:30.540
Since we said we'd carry you out of the grassland,

44
03:31.630 --> 03:34.430
we will definitely carry you out of the grassland.

45
03:52.560 --> 03:53.310
Commander.

46
03:54.440 --> 03:55.200
Houses.

47
03:56.370 --> 03:56.860
I…

48
03:57.290 --> 03:58.890
I think I saw

49
03:59.470 --> 04:00.240
houses.

50
04:01.600 --> 04:02.030
What?

51
04:02.030 --> 04:02.800
Houses.

52
04:03.320 --> 04:05.150
Are you hallucinating from hunger?

53
04:05.150 --> 04:06.430
Where are the houses?

54
04:07.710 --> 04:09.680
Comrades, we made it out!

55
04:10.020 --> 04:11.610
I see houses!

56
04:16.160 --> 04:16.950
Houses.

57
04:19.360 --> 04:20.430
We made it out!

58
04:22.580 --> 04:23.490
We made it out!

59
04:24.390 --> 04:25.680
Comrades!

60
04:26.560 --> 04:28.270
We made it out!

61
04:28.290 --> 04:29.170
We made it out!

62
04:31.160 --> 04:33.520
Chuan, hurry, hurry!

63
04:34.310 --> 04:36.630
Comrades!

64
04:37.000 --> 04:39.950
We made it out!

65
04:40.430 --> 04:42.120
We made it out!

66
04:42.320 --> 04:44.320
Hold on!

67
04:52.940 --> 04:53.940
We made it out.

68
05:13.360 --> 05:13.950
Let's go.

69
05:15.510 --> 05:16.270
Look.

70
05:16.630 --> 05:18.360
We made it out of the grassland.

71
05:19.240 --> 05:20.500
Let's go out together.

72
05:20.720 --> 05:21.430
Come on.

73
05:21.690 --> 05:23.450
Come up, come up.

74
05:23.630 --> 05:25.310
You can do it. Come on.

75
05:26.240 --> 05:27.000
Hold on to me.

76
05:27.430 --> 05:29.000
Here, hold on to me.

77
05:37.409 --> 05:38.540
Come on, keep going.

78
05:46.970 --> 05:49.680
We just received a telegram from Comrade Ye Jianying.

79
05:49.680 --> 05:50.960
The Right-Flank Advance Force

80
05:50.960 --> 05:53.159
has already driven back the enemy cavalry,

81
05:53.159 --> 05:54.159
taken Banyou,

82
05:54.480 --> 05:56.600
and is waiting for us there.

83
06:02.120 --> 06:03.750
All companies, count off!

84
06:04.560 --> 06:05.420
First Company!

85
06:05.570 --> 06:06.360
Report!

86
06:06.390 --> 06:08.190
First Company, 46 present!

87
06:08.510 --> 06:09.440
Second Company!

88
06:09.560 --> 06:10.430
Report!

89
06:10.950 --> 06:13.560
Second Company has 61 people left.

90
06:13.950 --> 06:14.950
Third Company!

91
06:15.430 --> 06:16.120
Report!

92
06:16.560 --> 06:19.240
Third Company has 49 people left!

93
06:19.800 --> 06:21.000
Fourth Company!

94
06:22.430 --> 06:23.660
Fourth Company!

95
06:25.120 --> 06:26.520
Where is the 4th Company?

96
06:26.750 --> 06:27.830
Report!

97
06:28.330 --> 06:30.060
The 4th Company and 5th Company

98
